      "key": "K0001",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 09:00 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:08 I passed through the square; around 08:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 08:15 to 14:15 I was at the mill; around 14:17 I passed through Mill Road; around 14:23 I passed through the square; from about 14:30 to 15:15 I was at the grocery; around 15:10 I passed through the square; from about 15:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
