      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0048",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 09:00 to 21:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 21:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 21:14 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:12 I passed through the square; around 22:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:15 to 16:00 I was at the mill; around 16:06 I passed through Mill Road; from about 16:15 to 17:15 I was at home; around 17:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 17:14 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 18:15 I was at the grocery; around 18:13 I passed through the square; around 18:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 18:15 to 19:15 I was at home; around 19:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 19:14 I passed through the square; from about 19:15 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:13 I passed through the square; around 22:15 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 9180,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
