      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 09:00 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:18 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:24 I passed through the square; from about 11:30 to 23:00 I was at the Lantern; around 23:02 I passed through the square; around 23:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:22 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:10 I passed through the square; around 09:16 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:16 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:22 I passed through the square; from about 11:30 to 23:00 I was at the Lantern; around 23:02 I passed through the square; around 23:08 I passed through Mill Road; from about 23:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 9180,
      "topics": [
