      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0153",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 7: from about 09:00 to 18:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 18:05 I passed through the square; from about 18:00 to 22:00 I was at the Lantern; around 22:03 I passed through the square; from about 22:00 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:10 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 17:15 I was at the grocery; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink; around 17:08 I passed through the square; from about 17:15 to 21:15 I was at home; around 21:10 I passed through the square; from about 21:15 to 22:15 I was at the Lantern; around 22:12 I passed through the square; from about 22:15 to 07:00 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 9180,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
